{
  "$comment": "Rogue's screen symbols drawn with Kenney's 1-Bit Pack (Display: 1-Bit; CC0, version 1.1, see upstream.env ONEBIT_*). Each 'at' is [row, column] of a 16x16 tile in the pack's colored_transparent_packed.png (48 columns, no spacing); 'tint' recolours a tile's pixels (monsters are tinted so they stand out from the hero; the floor is darkened). scripts/build.sh ships the sheet as it is; the page cuts and tints the tiles. LICENSES.md lists them.",
